# } on an Upcoming entry moves it under a later day and the focus goes with it.
file <<END
- First @due({today+1})
- Second @due({today+1})
- Third @due({today+3})
END
keys gU
see ▌ - First
keys }} k
see ▌ - Second
keys j j
see ▌ - Third
quit
saved <<END
- First @due({today+3})
- Second @due({today+1})
- Third @due({today+3})
END
